language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

contract PresentationContract.
interface PresentationInterface.
message-set PresentationIntents.
message-set PresentationUpdates.

PresentationInterface follows PresentationContract.
PresentationContract allows PresentationIntents.
PresentationContract specifies "Candidate schema/value/intent/outcome protocol; schema revision differs from data revision and rendered confirmation. Reconnect must recover coherent baseline; no widget code supplied by schema.".
PresentationContract status proposed.
PresentationContract allows PresentationUpdates.
PresentationIntents describes "Presentation incoming message family; exact allowed variants follow the cited schema or the associated contract gap.".
PresentationUpdates describes "Presentation outgoing message family; payload schema and variant routing need the declared contract.".
